# Ship ONLY the runtime. Everything is excluded first, then the pieces the
# extension needs at runtime are allowed back:
#   - the compiled extension + webview assets
#   - scripts/pi-server.mjs (the agent host)
#   - the three vendored packages it loads (see piCanvas.vendored in package.json)
**
!package.json
!LICENSE
!README.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md
!dist/**
!media/**
!scripts/pi-server.mjs
# The agent server's runtime deps, copied out of node_modules by
# `npm run vendor` (vsce refuses to package node_modules at all).
!vendor/**
